    "es": "No sé qué es peor, que exista el techno de tipo sonido-de-disco-duro-roto, o que no esté tan mal.",
    "en": "I don't know which is worse: that broken-hard-drive-sound-style techno exists, or that it isn't all that bad.",
    "noteEn": "The Spanish archive retains the English spelling techno. The broken-hard-drive comparison extends the comic's joke about mechanical, repetitive sound."
