      "promptEs": "techno",
      "answerEn": "techno; an electronic dance-music genre (printed with the English spelling)",
      "noteEn": "Spanish commonly retains the international spelling techno for the electronic dance-music genre. It can be used as a genre noun without an article after verbs such as escuchar or comprar.",
      "example": {
        "es": "Escuchamos techno en la fiesta.",
        "en": "We listened to techno at the party."
      },
      "tags": ["word", "music", "genre", "loanword", "A2"]
