      "noteEn": "Repetir changes e to i in some present forms, such as repito, but the unchanged dictionary form is repetir.",
      "example": {
        "es": "Voy a repetir la canción.",
        "en": "I am going to play the song again."
      },
      "tags": ["word", "verb", "repetition", "A1"]
